 379   000035  6754          SER                     /SKIP IF ANY ERRORS
 380   000036  7450          SNA                     /FIRST TIME THROUGH?
 381   000037  5020          JMP     SBREAD          /JUMP IF FIRST TIME THROUGH OR ERRORS
 382   000040  1061          TAD     SRXU            /GET CURRENT DENSITY SETTING; UNIT IS IGNORED
 383   000041  6751          LCD                     /LOAD "EMPTY SECTOR" COMMAND
 384   000042  1061          TAD     SRXU            /GET GOOD DRIVE
 385   000043  0046  S46,    AND     SGDCON/(360)    /REMOVE DENSITY BIT
 386   000044  1032          TAD     SRAL/(RAL)      /ADD ON "RAL" INSTRUCTION
 387   000045  3060          DCA     SBU             /STORE FOR COMPATIBILIY WITH RX01 ONLY BOOTSTRAP
