 389   000047  4053  SLP,    JMS     SLODE           /GET A WORD
 390   000050  3002  SLPSTR, DCA     SBOOT&177+2     /PUT A WORD
 391   000051  2050          ISZ     SLPSTR          /PUT TO NEXT
 392   000052  5047          JMP     SLP             /KEEP GOING UNTIL OVERLAYED
 393   
 394                 /       THE FOLLOWING WORDS ARE NEVER OVERLAYED. ALL OPERATING SYSTEMS PRIMARY
 395                 /       BOOTSTRAP BLOCKS MUST ASSUME THEIR PRESENCE IN ORDER TO LOAD AT ALL.
 396                 /       DEPENDENCE ON THESE WORDS PREVENTS SIGNIFICENT IMPROVEMENT OR ALTERATION
 397                 /       OF THE BOOTSTRAP CONVENTION IN THE FUTURE.
