 400   000054  6753  SLODE1, STR                     /TRANSFER FLAG UP?
 401   000055  5033          JMP     SHANGG          /NO, BUT DONE FLAG MAY BE UP
 402   000056  6752          XDR                     /DO TRANSFER IN PREVAILING DIRECTION
 403   000057  5453          JMP I   SLODE           /RETURN
