 411   
 412   000033  6755  SHANGG, SDN                     /BOOTSTRAP STARTS HERE; DONE FLAG UP?
 413   000034  5054          JMP     SLODE1          /TRY TRANSFER FLAG IF DONE FLAG IS NOT UP
 414   000035  7326          NL0002                  /SETUP FOR EMPTYING
 415   000036  6751          LCD                     /LOAD THE COMMAND
 416   
 417   000037  0000          ZBLOCK  SLP-.           /0000'S WILL EXECUTE AND FALL THROUGH TO SLP!
 418   
 419   000047  4053  SLP,    JMS     SLODE           /GET A WORD
 420   000050  3002  SLPSTR, DCA     SBOOT&177+2     /PUT A WORD
