 422   000052  5047          JMP     SLP             /KEEP GOING UNTIL SLP IS OVERLAYED!
 423   
 424                 /       THE FOLLOWING WORDS ARE NEVER OVERLAYED. ALL OPERATING SYSTEMS PRIMARY
 425                 /       BOOTSTRAP BLOCKS MUST ASSUME THEIR PRESENCE IN ORDER TO LOAD AT ALL.
 426                 /       DEPENDENCE ON THESE WORDS PREVENTS SIGNIFICENT IMPROVEMENT OR ALTERATION
 427                 /       OF THE BOOTSTRAP CONVENTION IN THE FUTURE.
